# 10. Advantages

* Reduces AI hallucinations.
* Improves factual accuracy.
* Increases user trust.
* Ensures transparent paragraph citations.
* Supports reliable document-based question answering.
* Demonstrates the core principles of Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).

---

# 11. Limitations

* The model cannot answer questions beyond the supplied document.
* Accuracy depends on the quality of the reference document.
* Requires updated documents when information changes.
* Limited to document-specific knowledge.

