# 13. Conclusion

This project successfully demonstrates Context-Anchored Answering using Prompt Engineering techniques. By restricting the AI model to a reference document, enforcing strict negative constraints, and requiring paragraph-level citations, the system generates reliable and factual responses while effectively preventing hallucinations.

